            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERelated links is a TPR component normally found in the right column of desktop layouts.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe heading defaults to \u0027Related\u0027 if left blank. It can be overridden sitewide by creating a dictionary entry called \u0027TPR Related links heading\u0027. This in turn can be overridden by setting the heading on an individual component.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
